fan","subject_person_id":"5is_zik_jbp_A","object_person_id":"5is_zik_jbp","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"弘子璠"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-guoshu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line129","quote":"郭舒，字稚行。幼請其母從師，歲餘便歸，粗識大義。鄉人少府范晷、宗人武陵太守郭景，咸稱舒當為後來之秀，終成國器。始為領軍校尉，坐擅放司馬彪，系廷尉，世多義之。刺史夏侯含辟為西曹，轉主簿。含坐事，舒自系理含，事得釋。刺史宗岱命為治中，喪母去職。劉弘牧荊州，引為治中。弘卒，舒率將士推弘子璠為主，討逆賊郭勱。滅之，保全一州。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line129:m0141","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line129:m0120"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-w043-guo-hong-fan-liu","subject_person_id":"5is_zik_jbp_A","object_person_id":"5is_zik_jbp","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"弘子璠"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-066","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession","quote":"及弘卒，弘司馬郭勱欲推穎為主，弘子璠追遵弘志，於是墨絰率府兵計勱，戰于濁水，斬之，襄沔肅清","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0017","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-066-jin043-guoshu:succession:m0001"}],"interpretation_note":"此條按本句所明言。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line129","text":"郭舒，字稚行。幼請其母從師，歲餘便歸，粗識大義。鄉人少府范晷、宗人武陵太守郭景，咸稱舒當為後來之秀，終成國器。始為領軍校尉，坐擅放司馬彪，系廷尉，世多義之。刺史夏侯含辟為西曹，轉主簿。含坐事，舒自系理含，事得釋。刺史宗岱命為治中，喪母去職。劉弘牧荊州，引為治中。弘卒，舒率將士推弘子璠為主，討逆賊郭勱。滅之，保全一州。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-guoshu:line129:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"郭舒","kind":"pers